{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:56:08+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-11T16:56:08+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"ArcelorMittal S.A.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"Luxembourg","city":"Luxembourg","website":"https://corporate.arcelormittal.com","employees":125554,"summary":"ArcelorMittal S.A., together with its subsidiaries, operates as integrated steel and mining companies in the Americas, Europe, Asia, and Africa. It offers semi-finished flat products, including slabs; finished flat products comprising plates, hot- and cold-rolled coils and sheets, hot-dipped and electro-galvanized coils and sheets, tinplate, and color coated coils and sheets; semi-finished long products, such as blooms and billets; finished long products consisting of bars, wire-rods, structural sections, rails, sheet piles, and wire-products; and seamless and welded pipes and tubes. The company also provides mining products, such as iron ore lumps, fines, concentrate, pellets, and sinter feeds; and coking coal. It sells its products to various customers in the automotive, appliance, engineering, construction, energy, and machinery industries through a centralized marketing organization, and distributors. The company operates iron ore mining activities in Brazil, Bosnia, Liberia, Mexico, South Africa, and Ukraine, as well as in India and in Canada. ArcelorMittal S.A. was founded in 1976 and is headquartered in Luxembourg, Luxembourg.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"ArcelorMittal S.A., avec ses filiales, opère en tant que sociétés sidérurgiques et minières intégrées en Amérique, en Europe, en Asie et en Afrique. Il propose des produits plats semi-finis, y compris des dalles; des produits plats finis comprenant des plaques, des bobines et des feuilles laminées à chaud et à froid, des bobines et des feuilles trempées à chaud et électrogalvanisées, du fer blanc et des bobines et des feuilles revêtues de couleurs; des produits longs semi-finis, tels que des fleurs et des billettes; des produits longs finis composés de barres, fils. La société fournit également des produits miniers, tels que des grumeaux de minerai de fer, des fines, des concentrés, des granulés et des aliments frittés; et le charbon à coke."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":44770209792,"shares_outstanding":751935008,"trailing_pe":50.45763,"forward_pe":9.324183,"price_to_book":0.9306087,"ev_to_ebitda":11.301,"ev_to_revenue":0.886,"dividend_yield":0.0091,"payout_ratio":0.52889997,"beta_yahoo":1.708},"targets":{"current_price":59.54,"mean":69.89275,"median":70.79376,"high":80.907036,"low":54.611816,"n_analysts":14,"reco_mean":1.57143,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2027-02-04"],"eps_avg":1.22257,"eps_low":1.14,"eps_high":1.27,"revenue_avg":17766829590,"ex_dividend":"2026-11-12","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.43894002,"institutions_pct":0.29036,"institutions_float_pct":0.51752,"institutions_n":444,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":1957,"value":116519,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0124}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.008,"shares":6217008,"value":370160662,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0041},{"name":"AMERICAN FUNDS INSURANCE SERIES-Eupac Fund","pct":0.0072000003,"shares":5545338,"value":330169429,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":16.9421},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST X-MFS International Intrinsic Equity Fund","pct":0.0069,"shares":5311632,"value":316254574,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":-0.0367},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0053,"shares":4122098,"value":245429718,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0074},{"name":"TR PRICE-Price (T.Rowe) International Value Equity Trust","pct":0.003,"shares":2314152,"value":137784612,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0934},{"name":"T